<p>Many of the properties of objects in the toolset make reference to 2DAs (two-dimensional arrays). These are read-only arrays containing various data used by scripting and the game engine. Each 2DA is simply an organized collection of strings and numbers. The specific function of each 2DA depends on how it is used by other systems in the game.
</p>
